      "trackName": "Turbo Race - Watch Game",
      "description": "Turbo Race Watch Game brings classic arcade racing to your Watch.\n\nRace against time, take sharp turns, and reach the finish before time runs out. Built for short sessions, it is easy to play anytime during the day.\n\nFeatures:\n• 3 unique worlds\n• 9 challenging tracks\n• Increasing difficulty\n• Speed meter and timer tracking\n• Best-time save system\n• Smooth retro visual style\n• Offline play\n\nControls are optimized for Watch:\n• Precise steering with the Digital Crown\n• Quick touch interactions\n• Fast and responsive race flow\n\nYour goal is simple:\nReach the finish, beat the clock, and set a new record.",
